  "hero_headline": "AI 基础设施独角兽崛起，全球市场震荡中寻找避险信号 / AI Infra Decacorn Emerges Amidst Global Market Volatility",
  "daily_overview": "今日科技界见证了 AI 基础设施领域的热度狂潮，Modal 估值飙升至 160 亿美元，与此同时，Agent（智能体）技术的实际落地应用正从企业办公向个人创客渗透。财经领域，随着 AI 泡沫担忧加剧，全球股市波动加大，投资者开始转向国债等避险资产，机构对 AI 基础设施的资本支出可持续性保持高度审慎。时政方面，美国社会动荡与政局纷争加剧，伴随多起校园暴力及政治法律诉讼，地缘冲突在也门及加沙地带持续引发供给侧风险。全球经济在战争、通胀与技术范式转移的三重压力下，表现出极强的韧性与脆弱并存特征。\n\nToday’s tech landscape highlights an infrastructure boom, with Modal reaching a $16B valuation, while agentic workflows continue to permeate both enterprise and individual sectors. In finance, rising concerns over AI bubbles have triggered market volatility, pushing investors toward safe-haven assets like Treasuries. Geopolitically, the U.S. faces significant domestic strife alongside ongoing conflicts in Yemen and Gaza, exacerbating supply-side risks. The global economy remains trapped between technological optimism and the fragile realities of war and inflation.",
